59-c218-45a4-ace6-7506cc74e908.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2023","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/ba4379c3-efc5-4b6b-8c8b-c79aab986926.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2022","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/517041/73406517041.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2021","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/517041/68972517041.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2020","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/517041/65254517041.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2019","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/517041/5170410319.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2018","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/517041/5170410318.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2017","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/517041/5170410317.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2016","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/517041/5170410316.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2015","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/517041/5170410315.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2014","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/517041/5170410314.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/517041/5170410313.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://archives.nseindia.com/annual_reports/AR_539_ADORWELD_2012_2013_16072013134530.zip","source":"the data provider"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Ador Welding Limited reported Q1 FY27 revenue of Rs. 309 Cr, representing a 23% increase year-on-year, supported by healthy order inflow and ongoing momentum from domestic and export markets. Management noted that operating margins are expected to remain at similar levels, driven by an improving product mix, cost discipline, and higher capacity utilization. The company is funding an ongoing Rs. 80 crore modernization and expansion capex program from internal accruals, with growth underpinned by exports, product mix enhancement, and customer engagement.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"Operating margins are expected to remain at similar levels.","quote":"Operating margins are expected to remain at similar levels, supported by an improving product mix, cost discipline, and higher capacity utilization.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=e8503d92-2e8f-4912-afeb-c7873b39baed.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"The Middle East remains the primary export market, with continued distributor expansion expected to support further growth.","quote":"• Exports: The Middle East remains the primary export market, with continued distributor expansion expected to support further growth.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=e8503d92-2e8f-4912-afeb-c7873b39baed.pdf"},{"claim":"Order inquiry base and approvals indicate that exports should do well in the operating markets.","quote":"So far this year, what we have seen is the order book, inquiry base, and approvals where we are set up, exports should do better -- should do well, should do better for the markets we operate in.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=a2247604-95cb-42ea-8a00-5290f24ff647.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"Annual capex for the welding segment is projected to be in the region of INR30 crores to INR35 crores, potentially stretching to INR40 crores over the next two years.","quote":"Our capex is generally in the region of approximately INR30 crores-INR35 crores for the coming year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=a2247604-95cb-42ea-8a00-5290f24ff647.pdf"},{"claim":"Maintenance capex is expected to account for approximately INR10 crores to INR12 crores.","quote":"Yes, so we have generally a maintenance capex and it will come anywhere in the region of INR10 crores-INR12 crores type scenario.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=a2247604-95cb-42ea-8a00-5290f24ff647.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Management stated that the company has the ability to improve its EBITDA margins by another 100 to 200 basis points over coming periods.","quote":"So I think on a similar trajectory, you can see that happen, for another 100, 200 basis points going forward over the coming periods.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=a2247604-95cb-42ea-8a00-5290f24ff647.pdf"},{"claim":"Standalone gross margins for the year were at approximately 38%, up about 250 bps.","quote":"For the year standalone, revenue is up about 2%, gross margins at 38%, up about 250 bps.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=a2247604-95cb-42ea-8a00-5290f24ff647.pdf"},{"claim":"Standalone EBITDA margin for the year was reported at 12%.","quote":"The EBITDA margin at 12%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=a2247604-95cb-42ea-8a00-5290f24ff647.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"Installed manufacturing capacity utilization is estimated at approximately 70% overall across various product lines.","quote":"Aditya Malkani: We are anywhere -- welding has a lot of different types of lines in consumables as well as in equipment, but I would say a fair estimate is anywhere in the region of approximately 70%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=a2247604-95cb-42ea-8a00-5290f24ff647.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[],"risks_headwinds":[]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"Management plans to achieve incremental EBITDA margin improvements of 100 to 200 basis points over coming periods.","quote":"So I think on a similar trajectory, you can see that happen, for another 100, 200 basis points going forward over the coming periods.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=a2247604-95cb-42ea-8a00-5290f24ff647.pdf","timeframe":""},{"claim":"The company expects capital expenditure for the coming year to be in the range of INR30 crores to INR35 crores.","quote":"Our capex is generally in the region of approximately INR30 crores-INR35 crores for the coming year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=a2247604-95cb-42ea-8a00-5290f24ff647.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":3,"kinds":["concall_ppt","concall_transcript"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":11,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":10,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped."}}